      "text": "teach them ordinances and laws, Ex. 18:20. God spake all these words, Ex. 20:1. two tables … written with the finger of God, Ex. 31:18. tables were the work of God, Ex. 32:16. words of the covenant, the ten commandments, Ex. 34:28. he wrote them in two tables of stone, Deut. 5:22. Moses commanded us a law, Deut. 33:4. nothing in the ark save the two tables of stone, 1 Kgs. 8:9. As it is written in the law of Moses, Dan. 9:13.",
